<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher than Friday's close. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA US 1-3    230-260 lbs    59.00-60.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-270 lbs    58.00-59.00</p>
<p>	    270-280 lbs    57.00-58.00</p>
<p>Sows steady. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    42.00-44.00</p>
<p>	   over 500 lbs    45.00-49.00</p>
</text>
